  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A circular loop of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is carrying current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. The ratio of magnetic field at the centre of circular loop and at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> from the center of the loop on its axis is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
